{"seq":3,"slug":"dialectic","title":"Dialectic","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/ideas-and-methods/dialectic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-dialogue-form","title":"对话体","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/ideas-and-methods/dialectic/the-dialogue-form","wordCount":2053,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-method-of-dialectic","title":"辩证法之路","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/ideas-and-methods/dialectic/the-method-of-dialectic","wordCount":2132,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现柏拉图独特的哲学方法。&quot;对话体&quot;是柏拉图的写作形式，它以苏格拉底为主角、以问答论辩展开，完美契合了&quot;共同探求真理&quot;的哲学精神，实现了文学与哲学的结合。&quot;辩证法&quot;则被柏拉图奉为通向真理的最高途径——它引导灵魂逐级上升，最终把握理念、乃至善的理念。本章揭示柏拉图方法的精神内核及其深远影响。</p>\n"}